#NEXUS

[ lerzo2021a_fig2: Titanosaur reduced consensus. The spoon symbols mark alternative positions of taxa (Ninjatitan pruned; Dzharatitanis under another scoring), not branches, and are not encoded. Lognkosauria, printed beside an open node circle, is kept as an internal label; the root's open circle carries no name. 28 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 7 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

